    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992590/extras/09c91db54c948c9c362ede84344a2050.poster.avif?t=1747289465\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992590/extras/09c91db54c948c9c362ede84344a2050.webm?t=1747289465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992590/extras/09c91db54c948c9c362ede84344a2050.mp4?t=1747289465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The new DLC introduces the story of the Fairy Queen, told through an interactive comic with erotic scenes. An elder fairy grants access to a premium section - unlock it to discover new secrets and enjoy unique content.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What's included:<br>\u2714 Alluring Fairy Queen - a new character<br>\u2714 4 story comics - immerse yourself in the tale<br>\u2714 5 steamy scenes - more passion than ever<br>\u2714 Expanded free mode - new possibilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992590/extras/fd1920a336316e069b94d0a44733535d.poster.avif?t=1747289465\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992590/extras/fd1920a336316e069b94d0a44733535d.webm?t=1747289465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992590/extras/fd1920a336316e069b94d0a44733535d.mp4?t=1747289465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fairy Massage - is a fairy massage simulator for adults. You are an ordinary guy, to whom a fairy flies by mistake and asks you to perform a massage. You have a unique opportunity to massage her well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992590/extras/423abd2f70c623d630462bd73435eef1.poster.avif?t=1747289465\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992590/extras/423abd2f70c623d630462bd73435eef1.webm?t=1747289465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992590/extras/423abd2f70c623d630462bd73435eef1.mp4?t=1747289465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game is waiting for you:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lea - A young and very naive fairy. He collects pollen from flowers and lights the way with his beauty. She strained her back while collecting pollen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melody - A fairy who loves to sing. During the concert, she loses her voice and loses the opportunity to charm everyone with her beautiful voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sabrina - Fairy witch and beauty, loves to brew creepy potions that keep her young.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Popi -  Fairy Chef and her delicious food is legendary. But unfortunately, she sprained her back and can no longer please everyone with delicious food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improving character skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meditative gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 beautiful fairies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
